# Only dist/, media/, the vendored backend and pets, README, CHANGELOG and LICENSE go into the .vsix (README images load from GitHub)
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview.js
!dist/webview-style.css
!media/**
# vendor/ by name: in vsce a ! pattern wins over any later exclusion, so with
# !vendor/** a __pycache__ left by a test run would ship (with this machine's paths)
!vendor/code/*.py
!vendor/pets/**
!vendor/statusline-snippet.sh
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
